<p>Would you like to give this sad academic a forever home? They specialize in geometry and topology, and really love math and teaching. They also enjoy long nature
 walks, hanging out with their friends, the occasional sci-fi or fantasy book and TV show, and doing various arts and crafts. They are low-energy and low-maintenance, are well-socialized, and would 
 get along with both older and younger academics in your department. They also like being around children, both literal and of college age. If your department is 
looking for a new teacher and researcher with a big heart and many happy years left, please consider giving Neza a forever home!</p>

